{title: Tu Jo Mere Sur Me}
{artist: Yesudas Chitchor}
{key: F#}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#]Tu jo mere sur men,        [F#]sur mila le, sng ga le
To jin [B]dagi ho [E]jaae [F#]safal,        [F#]Tu jo mere man ko
[F#]Ghar bana le,man laga le,        To ban [B]dagi ho [E]jaae [F#]safal
[F#]Chaandani raaton men,        haath lie [B]haathon men
Dube [E]rahe ek [G#m]dusare ki,        ras bhari [F#]baaton men
[F#]Tu jo mere sang men,        [F#]muskura le, gunaguna le
To jin [B]dagi ho [E]jaae [F#]safal,        [F#]Kyon ham bahaaron se
khushiyaan [B]udhaar le,        Kyon na [E]mil ke ham hi khud [G#m]apana
jiwan [F#]snwaar le,        [F#]Tu jo mere path men,
[F#]dip baale, ho ujaale,        To ban [B]dagi ho [E]jaae [F#]safal
